es_requested","summary":"The on-demand lifecycle, maintenance exclusion protocol and below-vault test fixtures are feasible against current code. One worker error-contract inconsistency remains: owner-side input rejection is specified to become an availability error on workers.","findings":[{"id":"runtime-r3-001","severity":"MED","location":"/body/errorPaths/errorCases/10","message":"The worker rule maps every rejected hub request to KeystoreUnavailableError, which also includes the owner's KeystoreInputError for malformed arguments. This contradicts the get/set/delete contracts and gives identical requests different errors depending on their thread. Preserve remote input rejection separately from owner availability and transport failures, and cover malformed worker requests in the integration strategy. The existing hub already transports remote error names, so this distinction is implementable.","evidenceReferences":["docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:46","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:69","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:92","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:261","src/daemon/threads/channel.ts: HubReply, HubRemoteError and HubClient reply reconstruction",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: body.testStrategy integration subjects"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/contractDetails","/body/dataModelChanges","/body/interactionWithShared","/body/errorPaths","/body/testStrategy","/citations/0","/citations/2","/citations/3","/citations/4","/citations/5","/citations/6","/citations/7","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: assigned contracts, data model, shared interactions, errors, tests and citations","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/ISSUE.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-669ae7a31701e106-S001.json: applicable lifecycle, initialization ordering, integrity and error-mapping requirements",".insrc/tmp/design-review/rv-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: completed scope and vault feedback","src/shared/keystore.ts","src/shared/daemon-run-files.ts: acquireRunFileGuard, runFileGuardConflict and ownership-preserving release","src/bin/insrc-connection-maintenance.ts","src/daemon/db/management-defaults.ts: initialization, per-root memoization and shutdown","src/daemon/db/management-startup.ts: integrity gates, rollback reads, enabled checks and cleanup","src/daemon/db/management-tickets.ts: SavedTicketAuthority.open","src/daemon/db/management.ts: managementRejection and savedManagementFor","src/daemon/db/secrets.ts: KeystoreLike and credentialKeystore indirection","src/daemon/connection-management-rpc.ts: owner, safeList, capabilities and management callers","src/daemon/db-rpc.ts: listing, saving and managed removal refusal","src/daemon/index.ts: boot loop, socket publication and shutdown ordering","src/daemon/server.ts: listen and close publication lifecycle","src/daemon/threads/channel.ts: hub payloads, remote errors and channel closure","src/daemon/threads/main-services.ts: connectWorker and serveHub installation","src/daemon/threads/worker-entry.ts: worker initialization and hub installation","src/daemon/threads/method-class.ts: connection and keys method classifications","src/daemon/handler-runtime.ts: keys handlers","src/daemon/tools/config.ts","src/daemon/tools/builtins/notify/index.ts: resolveSecretRef","src/daemon/tools/builtins/web/index.ts: Keychain-backed Brave lookup","src/daemon/db/__tests__/management-defaults.test.ts","src/daemon/threads/__tests__/helpers/daemon-socket.ts: spawned daemon and IPC fixtures"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Add explicit integration assertions for threads-disabled operation and an unrelated request completing while a fake Keychain read remains pending.","Extend guard tests to cover concurrent maintenance admission, a crashed owner's retained guard, and rejection of maintenance while a daemon already holds a cached vault.","Clarify that the next management request retries the root opener immediately, while the underlying denied Keychain load remains subject to its five-minute cooldown."]},{"chunkId":"visuals","status":"incomplete","summary":"All assigned sequence and companion source units were inspected. The revised source addresses the substantive fallback and persistence conditions raised by visuals-001 and visuals-002. Two retained descriptions remain inaccurate. Mandatory rendered verification could not be completed because browser access is unavailable.","findings":[{"id":"visuals-r3-001","severity":"LOW","location":"/body/sequenceDefinition/messages/4/description","message":"The description says a remembered refusal never reaches legacy lookup, but refusals expire after five minutes and then permit another lookup. The companion repeats this wording. Qualify the exclusion as applying during the cooldown so the description agrees with the retry contract and accepted prompt exceptions.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: body.sequenceDefinition.messages[4].description","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/sequence-diagram.html: Messages table, step 5","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:166","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:253-256"]},{"id":"visuals-r3-002","severity":"LOW","location":"/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/3/description","message":"The Keychain participant describes legacy items as held 'until copied', implying migration removes them. The migration contract explicitly retains these items after copying and removes them only on explicit deletion. Correct the participant description and regenerate its companion description.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: body.sequenceDefinition.participants[3].description","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/sequence-diagram.html: Participants table, macOS Keychain","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:192","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md:327-328"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/sequenceDefinition","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/0","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/1","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/2","/body/sequenceDefinition/participants/3","/body/companions","document:line:213","/Users/subhagho/work/projects/insors/insrc/docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/LLD.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: complete sequence definition and companion metadata","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/sequence-diagram.html: embedded Mermaid, narrative, all participant and message descriptions, rendering initialization and controls","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/ISSUE.md",".insrc/artifacts/LLD-669ae7a31701e106-S001.json: applicable contracts and error paths",".insrc/tmp/design-review/rv-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: prior visuals-001 and visuals-002 and current vault/runtime feedback","src/shared/keystore.ts"],"limitations":["Mandatory actual rendering inspection of docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/sequence-diagram.html remains unverified: opening the local companion through the browser tool returned 'The browser access host is unavailable'. Successful diagram generation, readability, clipping and layout cannot be established from the inspected HTML and Mermaid source."],"advice":[]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"incomplete","summary":"Reconcil