criptions, but those cannot establish successful rendering, readability or clipping."],"advice":["vault-r3-001 and runtime-r3-001 describe the same worker error-contract defect. Treat them as one correction: preserve owner-side KeystoreInputError separately from availability and transport failures, with malformed worker-request coverage.","Retain vault-r3-002, visuals-r3-001 and visuals-r3-002 without duplicating them here. They cover empty-value existence reporting, refusal cooldown wording and retention of copied legacy items.","Clarify that the next management request retries the root opener immediately while a denied Keychain load remains cached for five minutes.","Preserve the substantive reviews' optional coverage suggestions for unrelated-request progress, threads-disabled operation, maintenance guard recovery and additional migration interleavings."],"findingDecisions":[{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"visuals","findingId":"visuals-001"},"rationale":"Current authored and companion source now distinguish the vault path from legacy migration and qualify later cached reads to copied names. However, the fresh selected visuals inspection still lacks mandatory rendered verification. Preserve this origin unresolved rather than resolving it from source changes alone.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/LLD-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: body.sequenceDefinition.narrative and messages","docs/standalone/open-saved-connections-demand-read-all-E20261104fefa97b9/S001/sequence-diagram.html: embedded Mermaid and Messages table",".insrc/tmp/design-review/rv-fefa97b991537da7-s1.json: attempt 3 completedChunks visuals, rendering limitation"],"action":"carry"},{"source":{"attempt":2,"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope-002"},"rationale":"The current summary, chosen alternative, migration instructions and stakeholder citation explicitly accept repeated prompts after failed copies or denied reads. The lifetime bound is removed, and ac2 includes failed-copy and refusal-retry test